rt","historical_business_count":0},{"category":"Food","historical_business_count":3},{"category":"Bakeries","historical_business_count":0},{"category":"Desserts","historical_business_count":0}],"history":[{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Breakfast & Brunch, Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Food, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Food, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"9qdUEbbjzjcpPbXKeRN4zw","review_id":"S0yYX-m6PE8VR8DO2DFSLQ","date":"2021-05-02T20:44:29","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9367149472236633,"text_excerpt":"I called this morning for take out. The customer service experience was fantastic from the lady who took my order over the phone to the two ladies who rang me up and gave me my order upon my arrival. Since I'm an out of towner I decided to order a couple of things to try and have for leftovers. With the weather it took me about 1.5hrs before I was able to eat my food. After that time, my french toast was extremely soggy because of the styrofoam container retaining moisture, BUT like a review I had read, I didn't even need syrup bc it was the perfect amount of sweetness. I'm saving the fried chicken for later but they were crispy and smelled really good. I also had shrimp and grits (saving..."},{"business_id":"9qdUEbbjzjcpPbXKeRN4zw","review_id":"mfipeV9wBfZAewcp0na0lQ","date":"2021-11-13T16:07:20","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9327890276908875,"text_excerpt":"Excellent prices, big portions, and french toast on french bread, you can't beat this place. Can't wait to try out the rest of their options. Always past this place on my way to work, glad I stopped by. I'll be back!"},{"business_id":"9qdUEbbjzjcpPbXKeRN4zw","review_id":"umrUHc_gmjxm8I6cjGpdqw","date":"2021-07-04T15:14:03","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9285294413566589,"text_excerpt":"Now I'm not usually a sweets breakfast person, I tend to have a greater inclination for savory breakfast foods. But let me just say that this was the best French toast I've ever had. The dish was incredibly fresh, you can literally taste every spice used in the French toast and the French bread used gives the dish a unique New Orleans twist. The chicken breast was also outstanding, non greasy and excellently seasoning. A must for breakfast!"}],"visual":[]},"notebook_case":null}
